  "native_rules": [
    "AbilityTargetsAround.Select centres GetTargetsAround on the chosen unit EyePosition, then applies enemy/dead/untargetable/LOS filters.",
    "GameHelper.IsUnitInRange compares MechanicsDistance with selector radius plus recipient Corpulence and checks native LOS.",
    "AbilityData.GetApproachDistance uses actual custom range plus caster/target bodies for these casts.",
    "UnitPartSwarmAttack.HasEnemiesInInnerCircle reads its registered TargetsList, including unconscious entries; count/activation is not a facts-manager generation.",
    "UnitCommand.IsUnitCloseEnough squares ApproachRadius and checks command LOS from caster eye to Target.Point; TargetWrapper.Point is the unit body position.",
    "ScriptZoneCylinder.Contains inverse-transforms the world point before applying its local Center and Radius plus recipient body. World-circle hints therefore require an upright uniform XZ transform; other transforms retain the existing search."
  ],
